<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out as of 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out as of 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef higher on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice chuck and loin cuts higher, while rib and round cuts generally firm.  Beef trimmings generally steady on mostly moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
